 "body-18374", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Fabrication of Intraoral Occlusal Orthotic Appliances", "runs": [{"text": "Fabrication"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Intraoral"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Occlusal"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Orthotic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Appliances"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-18375", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "These devices are worn on the teeth like a retainer or a removable denture and are usually made of processed, hard acrylic.", "runs": [{"text": "These"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "devices"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "are"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "worn"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "on"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "teeth"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "like"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "retainer"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "removable"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "denture"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "are"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "usually"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "made"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "processed,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "hard"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "acrylic."}]}, {"id": "body-18377", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Physiotherapy", "runs": [{"text": "Physiotherapy"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-18378", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Perform manual manipulation, massage, and ultrasonography, which are helpful in reconditioning and retraining the masticatory and the other cranio-cervical muscles that are usually involved in temporomandibular disorders.", "runs": [{"text": "Perform"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "manual"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "manipulation,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "massage,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "ultrasonography,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "which"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "are"